<h1>Michael &quot;Mike&quot; Crawford</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 31st District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.drmikecrawford.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (drmikecrawford.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Says his priorities are increasing education funding and opportunities, equal rights, equitable health care access, supporting workers and their families, economic development, and public safety in the district. His site also cites work on students with disabilities, youth in care, and protecting seniors from scams.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>A postsecondary educator and administrator who worked at The Chicago School, City Colleges of Chicago, Chicago State University and Northern Illinois University; holds a Ph.D. from Concordia University Chicago.</p>
